{"v":1,"id":"a05d95109744","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"I came to you with seven hands, no sword upon my side","s":8.8,"e":17.34},{"t":"I wore the weight you couldn't lift, I let my innocence be tried","s":20.18,"e":28.28},{"t":"A thorny crown left these marks","s":31.22,"e":35.28},{"t":"They pierced hand and feet","s":37.14,"e":40.24},{"t":"This was not a weakness, child","s":42.58,"e":46.38},{"t":"I gave all for my sheep","s":47.8,"e":50.78},{"t":"Do not mistake the quiet","s":53.92,"e":56.38},{"t":"For a heart that does not burn","s":59.16,"e":61.94},{"t":"Mercy calling gentle whispers","s":65.48,"e":69.1},{"t":"So the world can finally learn","s":70.16,"e":73.3},{"t":"I am the same one","s":76.44,"e":79.5},{"t":"That bankrupt into a cup","s":81.4,"e":84.26},{"t":"The hand that heals and holds you","s":86.44,"e":90.38},{"t":"Will pour up out when time is up","s":91.84,"e":95.4},{"t":"I cannot shift my nature","s":98.22,"e":101.1},{"t":"My eyes burn with holy flame","s":103.34,"e":106.3},{"t":"I am the same one","s":109.74,"e":113.02},{"t":"I will always remain","s":114.26,"e":117.22},{"t":"I did not come confused or late","s":120.28,"e":124.14},{"t":"Nor unaware of men","s":125.82,"e":128.26},{"t":"I knew the cost of waiting long","s":131.36,"e":134.66},{"t":"I knew what tarries then","s":136.56,"e":139.5},{"t":"The lamb who stood before you","s":142.34,"e":145.54},{"t":"Was never blind to wrong","s":147.94,"e":150.6},{"t":"I chose to bear it silently","s":152.7,"e":156.44},{"t":"Until the time was gone","s":158.38,"e":161.42},{"t":"Compassion held the hour","s":165.2,"e":167.4},{"t":"Patience stayed my hand","s":170.68,"e":172.64},{"t":"But justice was not sleeping","s":175.48,"e":178.24},{"t":"Only waiting to stand","s":180.7,"e":183.38},{"t":"I am the same one","s":187.08,"e":189.82},{"t":"That banged wrath into a cup","s":191.58,"e":194.56},{"t":"The one that heals and holds you","s":196.66,"e":200.5},{"t":"Will pour out wrath when time is up","s":201.96,"e":205.5},{"t":"I cannot shift my nature","s":208.16,"e":211.12},{"t":"My eyes burn with holy flame","s":213.46,"e":216.28},{"t":"I am the same one","s":219.86,"e":223.0},{"t":"I will always remain","s":223.0,"e":227.16},{"t":"To show love by suffering","s":230.68,"e":234.38},{"t":"I chose the longest road","s":234.38,"e":238.16},{"t":"To heal wounds by waiting","s":241.58,"e":245.06},{"t":"I carried every load","s":245.06,"e":248.8},{"t":"But a love without passion","s":251.56,"e":254.94},{"t":"Will not rise and guard the pure","s":256.86,"e":259.84},{"t":"So my justice carried out","s":262.16,"e":265.36},{"t":"Is evil's final cure","s":267.22,"e":270.46},{"t":"I am the same one","s":274.18,"e":276.94},{"t":"The one that heals and holds you, will pour out wrath when time is up.","s":278.94,"e":292.86},{"t":"Do not fear the hour coming, dread mistaking who I am.","s":295.42,"e":304.02},{"t":"I am the same one, child","s":306.78,"e":311.62},{"t":"I always have been","s":312.22,"e":314.84},{"t":"Stay close","s":317.86,"e":320.06},{"t":"I will help you see","s":321.22,"e":325.1},{"t":"To understand what comes","s":327.88,"e":333.2},{"t":"Seek to know me","s":333.76,"e":335.36}],"match":null}
